B.Gv=new A.eh("seed-6","Fitness","Gentle Lumen","I stopped testing a deadlift PR the day before my period. The streak that mattered was showing up, not the number.",!1,!1,B.E)
B.Gw=new A.eh("seed-7","Rhythm","Lunar Cedar","Headaches on day 26, three cycles in a row. I am bringing the dates to my clinician. The pattern was the whole point.",!1,!1,B.E)
