B.Wb=new A.iE(["a poppy seed","A test can turn positive around now.","The usual comparison is a poppy seed. Dating still starts from the last menstrual period, before anything is visible.","A first prenatal visit is often scheduled once a test is positive."])
B.W9=new A.iE(["a raspberry","Organs are forming. Tiredness and nausea are common.","Many people feel wiped out. Small meals sometimes sit better than large ones. Tell a clinician about bleeding, severe pain, or fainting.","A dating visit is commonly offered around now."])
B.Wa=new A.iE(["a lime","The first trimester is ending for many people.","Energy sometimes starts to return. Nausea can linger. Genetic screening is a conversation, not an obligation.","Ask which screening, if any, fits the care you want."])
B.W7=new A.iE(["an avocado","Movement may still be too early to feel.","Especially in a first pregnancy, kicks often come later. Body changes can start to show. Pelvic pain that is sudden or one-sided needs a clinician.","This is a good week to write questions down while visits are still spaced out."])
B.Wd=new A.iE(["a banana","Halfway by the usual count.","Anatomy scans are often scheduled around now. Feeling movement becomes more common, and the pattern matters more than a single hour.","An anatomy scan is commonly offered between 18 and 22 weeks."])
B.We=new A.iE(["an ear of corn","Hearing is developing.","Glucose screening is often discussed in this stretch. Swelling that is sudden, or a headache with vision changes, is a same-day clinical concern.","Ask when glucose screening is planned."])
B.Wf=new A.iE(["an eggplant","The third trimester, by the common definition.","Kicks are usually a daily pattern by now. If the baby is much quieter than their usual self, call the care team the same day.","Visits often become more regular from here."])
B.Wg=new A.iE(["a squash","Practice contractions can appear.","Sleep gets more awkward. A contraction timer is a notebook, not a decision. Follow the labor rule your own care team gave you.","Ask what contraction pattern they want you to call about."])
B.Wc=new A.iE(["a papaya","Lungs are maturing.","Many babies settle head-down. Not all do, and position is a clinical check, not something to force.","Visits are often weekly. Confirm the plan for labor."])
B.W8=new A.iE(["a watermelon","A due date is an estimate.","Going past it is common. Induction, monitoring, and waiting are decisions for you and your care team, not for an app.","Confirm who to call overnight."])
